WEBVTT

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:05.735
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:10.006
Todoke Message

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:19.341
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:20.620
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:28.661
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:28.990
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:36.397
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.900
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:45.000
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:49.407
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.983
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:57.312
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:01.458
Todoke Message

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:09.961
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:14.339
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:18.541
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:28.444
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:44.168
Carrying a message from
Ensei Ro to deliver to Shurei...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.066
...Shorin, leader of the
Bald Eagles of Sa Province...

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.967
...headed quickly to the Sa Clan's
main residence as if he were flying.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.916
Meanwhile, in accordance
with Sakujun's request...

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.926
...Shurei was playing
the erhu after lunch.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.908
Shurei is here to
search for two things.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.178
One is the hairpin decorated
with a flower bud and the other is...

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:30.045
...the location where Kokujun Sa
and Lady Eiki are being held.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:40.482
A Woman's Word is Her Bond

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.693
I'm...

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:50.361
...going to take a nap now.
Come here again tonight.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.576
I truly do not get tired of you.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.681
I must locate where Kokujun
and Lady Eiki are right away!

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:12.191
Really, what's up
with this residence?

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.493
It's like some sort of maze.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:18.130
Which way should I go?

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.192
Okay.

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.179
Miss Shurei.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.373
You must be Shurei Hong, right?

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:36.971
Wh- Who are you?

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.552
Your erhu playing
earlier was wonderful!

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.954
Just like Ensei said, I knew
right away that it was you.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.650
So this is the first time that
we meet, Miss Shurei!

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:47.715
S-So who are you?

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.052
Oh, me?

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:51.824
I'm the leader of the chivalrous thieves,
the Bald Eagles of Sa Province.

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.066
My name is Shorin.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.260
The Bald Eagles of Sa
Province? What's that?

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:02.906
My father received many favors
from Mister Shoka a long time ago.

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:04.502
From father?

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:08.308
I've come here to help you,
and by doing so repay that kindness.

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:12.284
I've brought a letter
for you from Ensei Ro.

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:17.682
It's true. This is Ensei's writing.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:19.622
- We're finished with the cleaning.
- It's in your hands now.

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:22.456
- All that's left now is dinner preparation.
- Wh-What?! Huh?!

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.257
Speaking of which...

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.865
Earlier, I heard the sound of erhu
playing from one of the outer buildings.

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:29.967
Was that Master Sakujun playing?
It was so wonderful!

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:39.712
Why, this is...!

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:52.424
Oh? Do you now have feelings
enough to take a nap with me?

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:55.591
Please give me a
housemaid's outfit.

00:04:57.597 --> 00:04:58.757
Sure.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.995
Thank you. I'll borrow
this for a little while.

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:11.401
While I have you here, I'd like you to
tie my hair up, my lovely housemaid.

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:18.284
All right, I'm done.

00:05:19.218 --> 00:05:21.243
I hope you find what
you're looking for.

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:32.430
This is the perfect outfit...

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:34.466
...to gather information on what
goes on within the household.

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:37.002
Besides, I'm accustomed to
the work of a housemaid!

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:42.566
I'm definitely gonna find those two.

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:46.401
Chusho is a scary person,
don't you think?

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:48.674
Now that you mention it...

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:51.216
...have you heard the rumor about
Lady Eiki being banished by Chusho?

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:54.518
What? Figures. No wonder
I haven't seen her lately.

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:58.148
So to Chusho Sa,
Lady Eiki is an obstacle.

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.850
I'm quite used to cleaning toilets.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:06.060
Is it true that
Master Sojun has died?

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:08.830
Which would mean the next in line
for the position of clan head...

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.801
...is the prodigal son,
Master Sakujun.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.338
At least he's a better choice
than that undependable Kokujun.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:14.330
Which reminds me...

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.637
...there are rumors that he's been
placed under house arrest.

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:18.040
House arrest?

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:21.239
Which would mean that he's
somewhere within the premises.

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:34.860
A hidden room?

00:06:36.696 --> 00:06:38.664
This wouldn't be it.

00:06:52.145 --> 00:06:55.012
A secret passage?
But this isn't it either.

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:03.986
Just how many of
these do they have?

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:07.652
This residence is too strange!
There are way too many hidden rooms!

00:07:08.828 --> 00:07:12.457
And nobody's saying a thing
about Kokujun's whereabouts.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:17.459
I wonder where Kokujun is?

00:07:22.542 --> 00:07:25.306
Bring everything, to an end.

00:07:27.146 --> 00:07:30.809
Just like Great-Uncle
Enjun did. Everything.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.599
- It's no use.
- What are you doing over there?

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:51.603
I've come to collect the garbage.
Excuse me!

00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:57.910
That was close.

00:07:58.177 --> 00:08:01.010
Have you found what you're
looking for? My lovely housemaid?

00:08:02.782 --> 00:08:04.841
How about it?
Shall we have tea together?

00:08:04.917 --> 00:08:06.885
I've got work to do!

00:08:11.891 --> 00:08:14.792
Perhaps there's even a hidden
room in a place like this!

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:19.119
- Oh, you're working hard, I see!
- Ah! W-Well so are you!

00:08:20.566 --> 00:08:23.034
True. We've been so busy, yet we're
so understaffed, it isn't funny.

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:25.695
- Give me a break, I say.
- I suppose so.

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:28.005
Well, we've got the
selection ceremony...

00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:29.507
...for the clan's head and a wedding.

00:08:29.575 --> 00:08:32.043
I guess it can't be helped,
with all these celebrations.

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:36.281
But to think Master Sakujun
is getting married.

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:38.644
I hear his wife-to-be is a
princess of the Hong Clan.

00:08:38.718 --> 00:08:41.186
She also took the National
Exam even though she's a girl.

00:08:41.587 --> 00:08:45.580
I'll bet you she's always got a
frown on her face. Don't you agree?

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.350
I guess so.

00:08:49.095 --> 00:08:52.656
By the way, I wonder if Lady Eiki will
be attending the wedding ceremony.

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:55.364
L-Lady Eiki? I dunno.

00:08:55.902 --> 00:08:58.393
I'd like to meet her and see
what kind of person she is.

00:09:00.039 --> 00:09:02.007
You're new here, aren't you?

00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:04.676
You'd be wise not to talk
about Lady Eiki too much.

00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:06.708
Why is that?

00:09:06.779 --> 00:09:09.247
Everyone close to Lady
Eiki has been expelled.

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:12.383
In any case, if you attract the attention
of Lord Chusho, you're finished!

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:15.814
Rumor has it that both
Lady Eiki and Kokujun...

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:18.755
...are locked up somewhere
because they angered him.

00:09:21.127 --> 00:09:24.119
If Chusho Sa imprisons
anyone who gets in his way...

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:28.129
That would mean, considering
all these hidden rooms...

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.691
...if there's one in Chusho's room,
it would be the most suspicious.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.565
But it's not gonna be easy
to get into his room.

00:09:33.639 --> 00:09:35.698
Yes, it's definitely
suspicious there.

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:38.000
H-How did you get in?

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:38.941
Never mind that.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:41.476
I've searched around quite
extensively, but with that room...

00:09:41.547 --> 00:09:44.175
...the sound echoes back to
my feet in a weird way.

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:46.181
You went in? When?

00:09:46.852 --> 00:09:47.841
A number of times at night.

00:09:48.321 --> 00:09:51.484
It has the same sound as when I
make a trap hole to catch animals...

00:09:51.757 --> 00:09:54.749
...and tap the top with my foot.

00:09:55.461 --> 00:09:57.429
So, there's a basement?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.828
From the way my footsteps echo,
I know it's deep and spacious...

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:02.958
...but I also felt the presence
of something alive down there.

00:10:03.035 --> 00:10:05.503
So are you saying that
there's someone down there?

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:09.602
I can't say for sure,
but there's a good possibility.

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:12.644
A basement underneath
a private room.

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:15.610
It would be a perfect place
to keep someone locked up.

00:10:15.681 --> 00:10:18.081
Could you tell Ensei and the others
about this as soon as you can?

00:10:18.384 --> 00:10:20.318
Yeah, got it!

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:24.881
I understand now why
Ensei sent him here.

00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:28.193
I'm counting on you, Shorin!

00:10:30.062 --> 00:10:33.156
So there's a basement below old
man Chusho's room, is there?

00:10:33.499 --> 00:10:35.364
That's absolutely suspicious.

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.493
So that's likely where Lady Eiki is.

00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:42.032
No, if anyone's in there,
it would be Kokujun.

00:10:42.441 --> 00:10:44.909
Old lady Eiki is one tough
woman, so she's all right.

00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:47.142
I can't imagine she
would allow herself...

00:10:47.213 --> 00:10:49.681
...to be pushed into a room below old
man Chusho's room without a fight.

00:10:51.217 --> 00:10:53.208
Is Kokujun all right?

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:57.119
If Shorin says he sensed his
presence, then he's alive.

00:10:57.657 --> 00:11:00.626
Besides, now that So's dead,
Chusho would keep him alive...

00:11:00.693 --> 00:11:03.685
...as a backup in case something
were to happen to that Saku jerk.

00:11:03.896 --> 00:11:05.864
B-Backup?

00:11:06.399 --> 00:11:10.233
Shorin. Tell Princess that Kokujun is
the one imprisoned in that basement.

00:11:11.704 --> 00:11:13.672
Got it!

00:11:20.012 --> 00:11:24.972
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:31.457 --> 00:11:32.981
Shurei.

00:11:33.559 --> 00:11:34.685
Shorin!

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:36.318
Here's a message from Ensei.

00:11:36.395 --> 00:11:40.058
The person in the basement
is likely Kokujun.

00:11:40.666 --> 00:11:42.725
I see. But where do I get in?

00:11:43.235 --> 00:11:45.328
There wasn't a
mechanism on the floor.

00:11:46.138 --> 00:11:49.699
Then there must be an entrance
to the basement somewhere else.

00:11:50.309 --> 00:11:53.801
I'll search the residence again
in the middle of the night.

00:11:55.114 --> 00:11:57.605
Thank you. Be careful not
to let them discover you!

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:07.120
Say, isn't this residence
a little too suspicious?

00:12:08.327 --> 00:12:11.296
- Why are you saying this now?
- This isn't funny.

00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:15.125
Why are there so many hidden rooms?
It's obvious you've got a lot to hide.

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:18.335
Oh? It appears that you're
making some progress.

00:12:18.771 --> 00:12:21.262
Don't you love the challenge of
finding all the hidden rooms?

00:12:21.907 --> 00:12:24.068
So you're admitting
to hiding something, are you?

00:12:24.343 --> 00:12:26.311
Like I said, why are you
saying this now?

00:12:26.779 --> 00:12:30.044
Oh, but there's one thing
I'm not ashamed of hiding.

00:12:31.884 --> 00:12:34.375
How can you say that so bluntly?

00:12:43.562 --> 00:12:45.120
Wh-What?!

00:12:45.631 --> 00:12:49.067
There's nothing going on
between us yet that's shameful.

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:53.071
Or... do you want to change that?

00:12:53.572 --> 00:12:54.971
E-E-Enough already!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.406
It's good that there's at least
one thing you're not ashamed about!

00:12:58.511 --> 00:13:00.706
It's a pity. You keep putting it off.

00:13:06.752 --> 00:13:08.720
Oh, by the way...

00:13:08.988 --> 00:13:11.821
My grandfather says he'll
be meeting you tomorrow.

00:13:12.558 --> 00:13:15.083
Chusho Sa? He wants to
see me at this stage?

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:19.561
Well, for one thing, our wedding
ceremony will be held shortly.

00:13:20.032 --> 00:13:21.158
Our wedding?!

00:13:21.233 --> 00:13:23.463
Your wedding dress and your
trousseau are being prepared...

00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:25.436
...so you have nothing
to worry about.

00:13:25.905 --> 00:13:28.533
Wait! What are you going
ahead with this for?!

00:13:29.241 --> 00:13:31.004
You said you weren't interested...

00:13:31.076 --> 00:13:33.044
...in the formality of weddings
and marriage and stuff!

00:13:33.512 --> 00:13:37.073
Yes, in my case. It's my grandfather
who insists on these things.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:38.717
If you don't want to
go through with this...

00:13:38.818 --> 00:13:40.547
...tell him yourself when
you meet with him.

00:13:41.387 --> 00:13:44.083
I'll do that. I'll tell him
frankly and clearly!

00:13:44.156 --> 00:13:46.920
I believe in telling someone
what they need to be told.

00:13:48.394 --> 00:13:50.362
All this yelling has
made me thirsty.

00:13:53.432 --> 00:13:57.061
Say. You still don't feel like
brewing Gan Lu tea for me?

00:13:58.103 --> 00:14:00.970
No I don't! Today's
tea is Silver Needle.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.508
Really, you have such expensive
tea leaves readily available...

00:14:03.576 --> 00:14:05.100
...as if there's nothing
special about them.

00:14:05.177 --> 00:14:07.270
They're so valuable, it makes
me want to go and sell them.

00:14:07.346 --> 00:14:10.509
Really. Everything about this
residence is so wasteful!

00:14:11.383 --> 00:14:15.683
Marrying you.
That may be a good thing.

00:14:17.089 --> 00:14:19.683
I'm sure it's something
that'll be greatly enjoyable.

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:32.269
Good job on your patrolling.
How are things in the city?

00:14:34.106 --> 00:14:36.631
- Nothing out of the ordinary.
- Is that right?

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:39.644
I just hope this isn't
the calm before the storm.

00:14:40.546 --> 00:14:42.377
Here.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.344
- How is it? Tasty?
- It's terrible.

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:50.547
You're so mean. I put all
my heart into making it.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:54.416
Sure, it's not gonna compare to the
tea that Princess brews for you.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.688
A grasshopper shouldn't try to be
anything other than a grasshopper.

00:14:59.965 --> 00:15:02.433
As far as Princess is
concerned, she's all right.

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:06.129
Once the swearing-in ceremony for
the governors is out of the way...

00:15:06.205 --> 00:15:07.934
...we'll have her make
some Gan Lu tea.

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:11.676
- Just for me.
- That's not fair!

00:15:32.364 --> 00:15:34.332
I-It's you!

00:15:38.103 --> 00:15:40.936
I thought all along that she
was a newly-hired housemaid.

00:15:46.512 --> 00:15:48.480
Grandfather.
I have brought her here.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.642
Go on in.

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:16.163
So this man is Advisor Sa's
younger brother, Chusho Sa.

00:16:18.377 --> 00:16:22.837
Young lady. As a member of the
Hong Clan, do you despise me?

00:16:24.883 --> 00:16:27.249
I do recognize that,
among the Seven Colored Clans...

00:16:27.319 --> 00:16:31.881
...your bloodline is the most
superior after the eminent Ran Clan.

00:16:33.492 --> 00:16:35.960
You're wrong. This has nothing
to do with the Hong Clan.

00:16:36.261 --> 00:16:38.661
The reason that I refuse to bow before
you has to do with your use of the...

00:16:38.731 --> 00:16:40.961
...Murderous Blades as
your private army.

00:16:41.033 --> 00:16:43.524
You allowed them to ravage across
Sa Province and used any means...

00:16:43.602 --> 00:16:47.561
...to attack governors whom you
considered a nuisance.

00:16:48.407 --> 00:16:50.875
You also show no concern about
the casualties the citizens suffer.

00:16:51.377 --> 00:16:53.845
You've convinced yourself that
Sa Province belongs to you...

00:16:53.912 --> 00:16:56.346
...and that you're therefore
justified to do what you desire.

00:16:56.415 --> 00:16:58.883
As an official who has
accepted the king's orders...

00:16:59.118 --> 00:17:01.586
...I will not bow to any
person with such conceit.

00:17:02.388 --> 00:17:04.948
After the selection ceremony
for the head of the Sa Clan...

00:17:05.024 --> 00:17:07.959
...we will commence the wedding
ceremony for you and Sakujun.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.821
You shall remain quiet
and wait until then.

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.661
My only value to this man...

00:17:14.733 --> 00:17:17.133
...is as the direct bloodline
daughter of the Hong Clan.

00:17:17.603 --> 00:17:19.628
He sees me neither as a governor...

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:22.333
...nor as an individual worthy of
discussing issues with as an equal.

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:28.970
I decline the engagement
between Sakujun Sa and myself.

00:17:31.383 --> 00:17:34.409
If you know what's best for you, you'd
be wise not to say such foolish things.

00:17:35.187 --> 00:17:37.951
My only grandson will become
the next head of the Sa Clan.

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.824
That should be worthy enough
for even the Hong Clan.

00:17:40.893 --> 00:17:43.361
Your only grandson?
How about Kokujun?

00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:45.224
I don't know that person.

00:17:45.297 --> 00:17:46.355
You don't know?

00:17:46.432 --> 00:17:50.368
Not just Kokujun, you also
had another grandson, Sojun.

00:17:51.136 --> 00:17:53.104
You say such amusing things.

00:17:54.339 --> 00:17:55.033
This man...

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:59.167
He's erased the late Sojun's
existence like it's a natural thing to do.

00:18:00.746 --> 00:18:02.907
Would it be all right if I were to...

00:18:03.382 --> 00:18:05.976
...see to the burial of my older
brother Sojun's remains, alone?

00:18:07.686 --> 00:18:11.782
I'm sure now that the person
locked up below us is Kokujun!

00:18:14.626 --> 00:18:16.992
Seeing that this man has no
feelings of affection...

00:18:18.163 --> 00:18:20.256
...toward his own blood relative his
own grandson, it's very possible.

00:18:22.301 --> 00:18:25.532
There is no way that I
would marry your grandson.

00:18:26.505 --> 00:18:29.804
Leave your post as governor,
and become Sakujun's wife.

00:18:30.142 --> 00:18:33.236
You'll have a much easier life
here, surrounded by luxury.

00:18:33.779 --> 00:18:36.714
I have no intention of
complying with your request.

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:39.380
Are you saying that you refuse?

00:18:40.419 --> 00:18:40.646
Yes.

00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:44.089
Even if it meant Koren
would become...

00:18:44.156 --> 00:18:46.624
...a sea of flames on the day of the
governors' swearing-in ceremony?

00:18:47.593 --> 00:18:52.155
Or maybe violent mobs will start fights
simultaneously in each district...

00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:55.959
...causing all the mayors to run
back to where they came from.

00:18:56.835 --> 00:18:59.303
When that happens,
what can you do...

00:18:59.371 --> 00:19:01.839
...a little girl who just recently
passed the National Exams?

00:19:02.741 --> 00:19:05.539
You can do nothing but
cause destruction, I see.

00:19:06.278 --> 00:19:09.247
Yet, you have the power to protect
Sa Province and its people.

00:19:09.314 --> 00:19:11.475
That's pathetic.

00:19:12.017 --> 00:19:15.180
If you think you've made an
ally in the Merchants Guild...

00:19:15.721 --> 00:19:17.689
...you're in for a big surprise.

00:19:17.956 --> 00:19:21.790
They're merchants to the core, so
they'll easily change their loyalties.

00:19:22.628 --> 00:19:24.994
They'll follow anyone if
there's a profit in it.

00:19:25.564 --> 00:19:27.998
Didn't Sho Sai tell you that?

00:19:31.603 --> 00:19:34.071
Unfortunately for you, I've been
communicating with Sho Sai...

00:19:34.139 --> 00:19:36.630
...since before you came
into contact with him.

00:19:36.708 --> 00:19:39.142
He's given me all
kinds of information.

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:43.212
I'm also having him make a new
ring for the head of the Sa Clan.

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:46.145
Although he's been
delayed considerably...

00:19:46.251 --> 00:19:49.345
...with an increase in
work from elsewhere.

00:19:50.589 --> 00:19:53.183
You have my word that the
Merchants Guild of Kinka will commit...

00:19:53.825 --> 00:19:56.350
...eighty percent of its strength
to assist the new governors.

00:19:57.129 --> 00:19:59.597
In other words it could very well be
that the remaining twenty percent...

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:01.724
...is allocated to the Sa Clan.

00:20:02.201 --> 00:20:04.032
I'm sure you understand now.

00:20:04.102 --> 00:20:06.570
Now, just keep quiet and wait
for the wedding ceremony.

00:20:07.472 --> 00:20:08.439
I refuse.

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:13.311
Then shall I add Yushun
Tei's life to the balance?

00:20:14.346 --> 00:20:16.314
What do you mean by that?

00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:19.616
It's a simple thing to
burn that tower down.

00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:25.981
In his case,
there's no need to worry.

00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:29.755
The two of us decided to transfer
all authority as governors to you...

00:20:29.828 --> 00:20:33.491
...in the best possible state.
So please put your trust in Yushun.

00:20:34.566 --> 00:20:37.933
Okay, Ensei. If I doubt you now,
I'll put myself to shame.

00:20:39.204 --> 00:20:41.195
You've supported Sa Province
for the last ten years.

00:20:41.273 --> 00:20:43.741
How can I not trust your word?

00:20:45.544 --> 00:20:47.512
I declare my refusal!

00:20:47.813 --> 00:20:49.781
What did you say?

00:20:49.915 --> 00:20:52.816
I said, I declare my refusal!

00:20:53.552 --> 00:20:54.883
So you don't care if everything
goes up in flames...

00:20:54.953 --> 00:20:57.046
...because of your selfishness?

00:20:57.589 --> 00:21:00.217
Since nothing will be
going up in flames...

00:21:00.292 --> 00:21:02.817
...once again, I declare my refusal.

00:21:03.996 --> 00:21:06.396
Then you shall remain
in this residence...

00:21:06.465 --> 00:21:08.933
...until the deadline for you to arrive
at your assignment has passed.

00:21:09.901 --> 00:21:12.699
When that happens, you'll be relieved
of your assignment as governor...

00:21:13.105 --> 00:21:17.303
...and the governor's seal that was
given to you will lose its validity.

00:21:19.011 --> 00:21:19.978
That's fine.

00:21:21.313 --> 00:21:22.280
Before I came here...

00:21:22.347 --> 00:21:25.316
...I wrote an official letter for the
other governor, Eigetsu To...

00:21:25.817 --> 00:21:30.220
...to transfer all authority to
him in case of an emergency.

00:21:30.822 --> 00:21:32.790
I've left the governor's
seal with him.

00:21:33.692 --> 00:21:36.490
So even if the deadline for arriving
at my assignment has passed...

00:21:36.561 --> 00:21:39.530
...nothing will change, except the fact
that there will be one less governor.

00:21:40.198 --> 00:21:42.189
Didn't you come here to celebrate...

00:21:42.267 --> 00:21:45.293
...the selection of the new
head of Sa Clan as governor?!

00:21:45.704 --> 00:21:50.198
No. I came here as an individual,
to look for two things.

00:21:52.878 --> 00:21:55.346
Of course, a governor
will attend the ceremony.

00:21:55.947 --> 00:21:59.280
Governor To will proudly arrive
here on the day of the ceremony...

00:21:59.785 --> 00:22:02.276
...accompanied by Ensei Ro,
the Lieutenant Governor.

00:22:03.055 --> 00:22:05.023
You'll pay for mocking me, girl!

00:22:06.591 --> 00:22:09.560
On the day of the Sa Clan
selection ceremony...

00:22:09.628 --> 00:22:11.323
...you shall regret saying that...

00:22:11.697 --> 00:22:14.165
...when you see every region of
Sa Province go up in flames!

00:22:30.615 --> 00:22:32.810
They say that a man's
word is his bond.

00:22:34.853 --> 00:22:37.321
But a woman's word
is her bond as well!

00:22:59.378 --> 00:23:01.346
That witch.

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:35.572
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:42.118
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:47.381
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:52.689
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.698 --> 00:23:58.101
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.638 --> 00:24:04.769
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.544 --> 00:24:16.113
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:16.988 --> 00:24:22.585
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:22.994 --> 00:24:28.057
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:34.497
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.873 --> 00:24:41.676
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:45.550
Next Episode

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:48.119
Next Episode
The long-awaited day of the selection
ceremony for the new head...

00:24:48.119 --> 00:24:48.153
Next Episode
No Use Crying Over Spilt Milk

00:24:48.153 --> 00:24:51.823
Next Episode
No Use Crying Over Spilt Milk
...of the Sa Clan has finally come.
So why is that man so relaxed?

00:24:51.823 --> 00:24:53.058
Next Episode
No Use Crying Over Spilt Milk

00:24:53.058 --> 00:24:54.753
Next Episode
No Use Crying Over Spilt Milk
You want me to make
Gan Lu tea for you?

00:24:54.826 --> 00:24:57.454
You're asking for too much!
Have some hot water instead!
